### Fioner API — VS Code REST Client (extension: humao.rest-client)
### Run "Login" first; @accessToken fills in from the response.

@host = http://localhost:4000/api/v1
@email = owner@fioner.test
@password = Password123

### Health
GET {{host}}/health/ready

### Login
# @name login
POST {{host}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "{{email}}",
  "password": "{{password}}"
}

@accessToken = {{login.response.body.data.tokens.accessToken}}
@refreshToken = {{login.response.body.data.tokens.refreshToken}}
@orgId = {{login.response.body.data.activeOrganizationId}}

### Register a brand new account + organization
POST {{host}}/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "firstName": "Test",
  "lastName": "User",
  "email": "test.user@example.com",
  "password": "Password123",
  "organizationName": "Test Co"
}

### Who am I
GET {{host}}/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Rotate tokens
POST {{host}}/auth/refresh
Content-Type: application/json

{ "refreshToken": "{{refreshToken}}" }

### Current organization
GET {{host}}/organizations/current
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
X-Organization-Id: {{orgId}}

### Members
GET {{host}}/users?page=1&limit=20
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
X-Organization-Id: {{orgId}}

### Invite a member (ADMIN+)
POST {{host}}/users/invite
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
X-Organization-Id: {{orgId}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "new.member@example.com",
  "firstName": "New",
  "lastName": "Member",
  "role": "MEMBER",
  "temporaryPassword": "Password123"
}

### Leads
GET {{host}}/crm/leads?page=1&limit=20&sortBy=createdAt&sortOrder=desc
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
X-Organization-Id: {{orgId}}

### Leads by status
GET {{host}}/crm/leads?status=QUALIFIED
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
X-Organization-Id: {{orgId}}

### Lead stats
GET {{host}}/crm/leads/stats
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
X-Organization-Id: {{orgId}}

### Create a lead
POST {{host}}/crm/leads
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
X-Organization-Id: {{orgId}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Arjun Mehta",
  "email": "arjun@example.com",
  "company": "Mehta Industries",
  "source": "website",
  "status": "NEW",
  "value": 60000
}

### Validation error example (missing name)
POST {{host}}/crm/leads
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
X-Organization-Id: {{orgId}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "not-an-email" }
